CORE broken-cprover-smt-backend no-new-smt
main.c
--no-simplify
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
As test.desc, but without constant folding, so that the solver encoding has to
produce quiet NaNs. The SMT back-ends (--cprover-smt2, the incremental one)
cannot yet read the bits of a non-constant float without simplification.
